      "writtenOn": "2017-10-24T16:34:57Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "HCPv4 will use macros to pull out bitfields since those are stable across processors / compilers.  See for example src/platform/vboot_reference/firmware/2lib/include/2nvstorage_fields.h\n\n#define EC_COMM_HEADER_DIRECTION_MASK 0x01\n#define EC_COMM_HEADER_SEQ_MASK 0x06\n#define EC_COMM_HEADER_SEQ_SHIFT 1\n#define EC_COMM_HEADER_VERSION_MASK 0x38\n#define EC_COMM_HEADER_VERSION_SHIFT 3\n/* Reserved, set 0, ignore on read: mask 0xC0 */\n\nand then \n\nstruct ec_comm_header {\n  uint8_t header;  /* Header bitfields - see EC_COMM_HEADER_* /\n}\n\nSo we\u0027ll have to convert at some point.",
      "parentUuid": "ba6a1d78_cc047289",
