      "writtenOn": "2017-10-26T19:12:17Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "is it really necessary to save the request? Code that send the request expeting a response has enough information to know what the response is about.",
      "revId": "517c6b016625c5277d28a4abaac9e4120e4a250d",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba",
